6 - File Guide
    ----------

    L001_00_Premises.v

      Abstract closure vocabulary, negation fixed points, global and local
      detachment, consistency, classification interfaces, and the
      goal-restricted evaluation frame.

    L001_01__Aporetic_Lemma.v

      Goal-restricted diagonal production, branchwise and goal-relative
      collapse, and the retained local branch collapse.

    L001_02__Aporetic_Obstruction.v

      Fixed-point gap, local obstruction, signed and membership obstructions,
      and generic refutation inhabitation.

    L001_95_API.v

      Stable public API and the six canonical contracts `LOCAL_COLLAPSE`,
      `LOCAL_OBSTRUCTION`, `NEGATION_DIAGONAL`, `SIGNED_OBSTRUCTION`,
      `MEMBERSHIP_OBSTRUCTION`, and `REFUTATION_INHABITED`.

    L001_97_Artifacts.v

      Certifies `L001_CONTRACT` as `l001_contract_qed` and redirects its
      assumption report.

    _appendix/_assumptions/

      Redirected `Print Assumptions` output for `l001_contract_qed`.


