8 - Notes
    -----

    L001 imports only `M001_00_Premises`. It depends on M001's primitive
    formula syntax, not on the checker, proof transformations, symbolic
    regulator, or release gate.

    L001 contains no full-frame compatibility layer, global-LEM wrapper,
    regulator specialization, status branch, Curry-labelled restatement,
    decision/decider alias, or legacy contract surface. Derived strengthening
    endpoints do not enlarge `L001_CONTRACT`.

    L002 consumes L001's goal-restricted frame and negation-fixed-point
    vocabulary. It separately specializes those notions to M001 checked
    derivability and develops the one-way mirror and coded-recognition layer.
